OL,3,GNEWSAMarket and town halls: Historic
OL,4,Asites being left to ruin
OL,5,
OL,6,FHistoric buildings make up key
OL,7,Flandmarks across the West of England,
OL,8,Fattracting thousands of tourists every
OL,9,Fyear.
OL,11,FBut maintaining them can be expensive
OL,12,Fand two new sites in our region have
OL,13,Fbeen placed on Historic England's
OL,14,FHeritage at-risk register.
OL,16,FAcross England, there are close to
OL,17,F5,000 buildings, places of worship,
OL,18,Farchaeological sites and protected
OL,19,Fwreck sites on the register, which
OL,20,Fshows they are at risk of neglect,
OL,21,Fdecay or inappropriate change.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
